+# Two-slot material candidate
+
+Isolated candidate; not adopted. Two alternating verified swatches over 23 real source poses yielded identical frame hashes to baseline in two runs and lower warm-switch median. Three-swatches cycling yielded identical hashes but a slightly slower single-run median. Cold selection remains slow. Real assets are private and excluded; no native-game, browser, or full-CAS acceptance is implied. Review retained private evidence and test memory, failure rollback, varied workloads, and target behavior before considering adoption.
